해 참상이 널리 알려졌다. 캄보디아 공산화 이후 처음으로 1988년 입국한 조선일보 기자는 학살 현장 중 하나인 프놈펜 인근 처형장의 참상을 전했다.","date":"2026-04-14T20:00:00.000Z","url":"https://www.chosun.com/culture-life/culture_general/2026/04/15/N3SMSCM3IRFWHCJWILNIAZAUT4/"},{"spec":{"publisher":{"id":"chosun","name":"조선일보","type":"종합일간지","url":"https://www.chosun.com"},"title":"문화/라이프","categories":["culture"],"url":"https://www.chosun.com/arc/outboundfeeds/rss/category/culture-life/?outputType=xml"},"title":"이봉원 “박미선 유방암 치료 끝, 추이 지켜봐야”","partialText":"","date":"2026-04-14T16:12:43.000Z","url":"https://www.chosun.com/culture-life/k-culture/2026/04/15/YFGW3JSV2BEC5HN3X4AFSWYWOY/"},{"spec":{"publisher":{"id":"chosun","name":"조선일보","type":"종합일간지","url":"https://www.chosun.com"},"title":"문화/라이프","categories":["culture"],"url":"https://www.chosun.com/arc/outboundfeeds/rss/category/culture-life/?outputType=xml"},"title":"[그 영화 어때] 지브리 할아버지의 3598일 작업 브이로그","partialText":"","date":"2026-04-14T21:00:01.000Z","url":"https://www.chosun.com/culture-life/culture_general/2026/04/15/WNMWTG3Z4BEI3HVI7YWNKKWXX4/"},{"spec":{"publisher":{"id":"chosun","name":"조선일보","type":"종합일간지","url":"https://www.chosun.com"},"title":"문화/라이프","categories":["culture"],"url":"https://www.chosun.com/arc/outboundfeeds/rss/category/culture-life/?outputType=xml"},"title":"[일사일언] 번거로워서 더 편한 아날로그","partialText":"","date":"2026-04-14T15:41:00.000Z","url":"https://www.chosun.com/culture-life/culture_general/2026/04/15/P2HH5R3PFJDLFNZBRK6M2CVQ5I/"},{"spec":{"publisher":{"id":"chosun","name":"조선일보","type":"종합일간지","url":"https://www.chosun.com"},"title":"문화/라이프","categories":["culture"],"url":"https://www.chosun.com/arc/outboundfeeds/rss/category/culture-life/?outputType=xml"},"title":"[리빙포인트] 건조기에 테니스공 넣어보세요","partialText":"","date":"2026-04-14T14:35:00.000Z","url":"https://www.chosun.com/culture-life/living/2026/04/14/3XU45KO5SZBPBFUSBLWHFXYKGY/"},{"spec":{"publisher":{"id":"chosun","name":"조선일보","type":"종합일간지","url":"https://www.chosun.com"},"title":"문화/라이프","cate